{"date":"2005-12-30","platform":"TV","images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/200/pic/cover/l/f5/de/103161_QHBgR.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/cover/l/f5/de/103161_QHBgR.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/cover/l/f5/de/103161_QHBgR.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/800/pic/cover/l/f5/de/103161_QHBgR.jpg","common":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/cover/l/f5/de/103161_QHBgR.jpg"},"summary":"很久以前，天下有一位叫女娲的女神。她使用光明之土和光明之水创造了自己的孩子――龙娃、凤娃，用凡土和水创造了人类。可是由于天层破裂，女娲为了天下苍生，用五色石补天，无奈中把龙娃和凤娃补上了天。于是母子相隔天地……\r\n百年后，天完好无缺。可是邪恶侵袭人间，人类面临危机。女娲遭受邪恶所迫被困“绝世界”。她只能用眼泪哭诉天下之危机，她的泪水变成了一条河，后人称“母亲河”又叫黄河。而龙凤双娃终于学成本领，获得天界神剑，重返天下。他们沿着黄河寻找他们的母亲，并同邪恶之势进行勇敢斗争……\r\n本片取材中国民间传说，描述传说中女娲创造出的龙娃、凤娃勇斗黑怪的曲折过程。民族自强的重要。","name":"东方神娃","name_cn":"东方神娃","tags":[{"name":"国产","count":161,"total_count":161356},{"name":"童年","count":127,"total_count":93248},{"name":"TV","count":83,"total_count":1408345},{"name":"2005","count":55,"total_count":23595},{"name":"奇幻","count":44,"total_count":473503},{"name":"原创","count":33,"total_count":622147},{"name":"电视","count":16,"total_count":561},{"name":"2005年","count":14,"total_count":1261},{"name":"cctv","count":14,"total_count":147},{"name":"中国","count":12,"total_count":31895},{"name":"TV（集数50-99）","count":10,"total_count":97},{"name":"没看全","count":8,"total_count":1814},{"name":"战斗","count":6,"total_count":473635},{"name":"无锡天龙动画有限公司","count":5,"total_count":5},{"name":"中推","count":3,"total_count":715},{"name":"剧集","count":3,"total_count":4352},{"name":"童年补完计划","count":2,"total_count":277},{"name":"国产动画","count":2,"total_count":5635},{"name":"TVA-01","count":2,"total_count":55},{"name":"子供向","count":2,"total_count":13019},{"name":"江苏省盛世影视文化有限公司","count":2,"total_count":2},{"name":"益智","count":1,"total_count":83},{"name":"2000s","count":1,"total_count":3076},{"name":"玄幻","count":1,"total_count":8538},{"name":"留念","count":1,"total_count":32},{"name":"童年回忆other","count":1,"total_count":31},{"name":"励志","count":1,"total_count":28371},{"name":"神话","count":1,"total_cou